🔹 6. How does Kruskal’s algorithm avoid cycles?
Answer:
Kruskal’s algorithm uses the Disjoint Set (Union-Find) data structure to avoid cycles. Before adding an edge, it uses the find() function to check if the two vertices belong to different sets.________________________________________
